"692 CONTRACT IN PEEVYHOUSE V. GARLAND COAL & MINING CO.* * 382 P.2d 109 (Okla.1962). Thanks to Professor Judith L. Maute for unearthing this contract. Prof. Maute describes the lease as “a preprinted form lease containing some handwritten modifications and one typed page defining the remedial and other specific duties.” Maute, Peevyhouse v. Garland Coal and Mining Co. Revisited: The Ballad of Willie and Lucille, 89 Northwestern L. Rev. 1341 (1995). We include a copy of the original lease followed by a more legible, retyped version. SELECTED CONTRACTS"